          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Sitting all day shouldn't leave you feeling sore and worn out. If your lower back aches after hours at your desk or your seat feels flat and unforgiving by mid-afternoon, it’s time for a better solution. The Sihoo M56 <a href=\"https://sihoo.com.au/\">ergonomic chair in Australia</a> is designed to relieve daily pressure with dynamic lumbar support and a soft, contoured seat—so you can sit comfortably, stay focused, and get through your workday without the strain.</p>",
